{"reviewId": "52366722_88FyCjEcE", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "追赶国总是在先发国的增长率见顶后迎来机遇，先发国的优势资本和技术在本国市场遇到增长瓶颈后自然会转发追赶国，进而带动追赶国的技术进步和需求增长，从根源上说，人口和政局稳定与否决定了是否能发展起来，其他方面的影响其次。当前突出的追赶国是越南及印度，未来可能在非洲。", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "追赶国在康波的繁荣后期至衰退期进入工业化起飞阶段，这是康波中的一个重要现象，包括第四次康波中工业化的日本和第五次康波中工业化的中国，都具有类似的情况", "range": "14624-14698", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "52366722_88FyCjEcE", "userVid": 52366722, "topics": [], "createTime": 1777254286, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 52366722, "name": "胖头带鱼", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/ic3ibEjvYaKJwdcLt8Z27pL9ibSxgCQG7nvcLanPLMZHxbb82RjibQBnCKtCnPhxRlqnoeKhsHUnCDw/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-365", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 365}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 13, "likes": [{"userVid": 60306681, "name": "无🈚️", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0020-3yZmckYVz1fF9_Soh2KFv93/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "无🈚️", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-5", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作研习生", "levelIndex": 5}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "人口东大确实没有太多的红利了 政局还算稳定", "reviewId": "52366722_88FyCjEcE", "commentId": "52366722_88FyCjEcE_c936814101_8bZv9pAja", "userVid": 936814101, "createTime": 178